msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/commitmentBeneficiaryDistinctness|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "a commitment's beneficiary is distinct from its committed agent"
msgstr "承诺的受益者不同于做出承诺的主体"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/commitmentBeneficiaryDistinctness|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts that a gmeow:Commitment's gmeow:committedAgent and gmeow:commitmentBeneficiary must be distinct: a resolution made purely to oneself is an Intention, not a Commitment. The native coherence gate raises a violation when they coincide."
msgstr "断言一个 gmeow:Commitment 的 gmeow:committedAgent 与 gmeow:commitmentBeneficiary 必须相异:纯粹对自己作出的决意是一个 Intention,而非 Commitment。当二者重合时,原生一致性门抛出一个违规。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/committedAgentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "committedAgent is functional"
msgstr "committedAgent 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/committedAgentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:committedAgent is functional: a gmeow:Commitment binds exactly one committed agent, mutual promises being modelled as two directed Commitments so that withdrawal, breach, and tenure stay independent per direction. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:committedAgent 是函数式的：一个 gmeow:Commitment 恰好绑定一个被约束的主体，相互承诺被建模为两个有方向的 Commitment，从而使撤回、违约和存续期在各自方向上保持独立。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/counterGoalIrreflexivity|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "counterGoal is irreflexive"
msgstr "counterGoal 具有非自反性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/counterGoalIrreflexivity|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:counterGoal is irreflexive: a goal is never its own shadow, as its skos:definition states. The native coherence gate reads this to raise a violation for a goal asserted to counter itself."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:counterGoal 是非自反的：一个目标绝不是其自身的影子，正如其 skos:definition 所述。原生融贯性关卡读取此断言，为被断言与自身相对的目标引发一项违反。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/counterGoalSymmetry|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "counterGoal is symmetric"
msgstr "counterGoal 具有对称性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/counterGoalSymmetry|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:counterGoal is symmetric: each pole of a constitutive opposition constitutes the other, as its skos:definition states. The native coherence gate reads this to mirror the opposition. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:counterGoal 是对称的：一种构成性对立的每一极都构成另一极，正如其 skos:definition 所述。原生融贯性关卡读取此断言以镜像该对立。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/intentBearerFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "intentBearer is functional"
msgstr "intentBearer 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/intentBearerFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:intentBearer is functional: an intentional mode is an intrinsic moment that inheres in exactly one bearer, so two agents wanting the same outcome are two modes sharing a single gmeow:intentionGoal. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:intentBearer 是函数性的:一个意向模式是内在于恰好一个承载者的内在时刻,因此想要同一结果的两个主体构成共享同一个 gmeow:intentionGoal 的两个模式。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/intentionGoalFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "intentionGoal is functional"
msgstr "intentionGoal 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/intentionGoalFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:intentionGoal is functional: an intentional moment aims at exactly one goal, so an agent pursuing five goals bears five modes and sharing occurs at the Goal individual rather than the mode."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:intentionGoal 是函数性的:一个意向时刻恰好指向一个目标,因此追求五个目标的主体承载五种模式,共享发生在 Goal 个体层面,而不是模式层面。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tenureAgentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "tenureAgent is functional"
msgstr "tenureAgent 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tenureAgentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:tenureAgent is functional: a gmeow:IntentionTenure records the intentional mode of exactly one agent. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:tenureAgent 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:IntentionTenure 恰好记录一个主体的意向模式。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tenureIntentionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "tenureIntention is functional"
msgstr "tenureIntention 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tenureIntentionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:tenureIntention is functional: a gmeow:IntentionTenure records exactly one intrinsic desire or intention over its interval, so adopting another mode opens a separate tenure. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:tenureIntention 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:IntentionTenure 在其区间内恰好记录一种内在欲望或意向,采用另一种模式则会开启一个独立的保有。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/counterGoalSymmetry|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:counterGoal holds in both directions; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:counterGoal 在两个方向上都成立 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/counterGoalSymmetry|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when the relation is genuinely one-way — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当该关系确实是单向的时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/counterGoalSymmetry|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:counterGoal, logic:characteristicSort logic:symmetricProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:counterGoal, logic:characteristicSort logic:symmetricProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/counterGoalSymmetry|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:counterGoalSymmetry logic:characterizes gmeow:counterGoal ."
msgstr "gmeow:counterGoalSymmetry logic:characterizes gmeow:counterGoal ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/counterGoalIrreflexivity|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:counterGoal never relates a subject to itself; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:counterGoal 绝不将主体关联到自身 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/counterGoalIrreflexivity|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a self-edge is meaningful — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当自环是有意义的时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/counterGoalIrreflexivity|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:counterGoal, logic:characteristicSort logic:irreflexiveProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:counterGoal, logic:characteristicSort logic:irreflexiveProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/counterGoalIrreflexivity|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:counterGoalIrreflexivity logic:characterizes gmeow:counterGoal ."
msgstr "gmeow:counterGoalIrreflexivity logic:characterizes gmeow:counterGoal ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/committedAgentFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:committedAgent names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:committedAgent 恰好命名一个值 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

