msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/commitmentBeneficiaryDistinctness|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce this record's integrity condition over gmeow:Commitment; the record is the canonical carrier the gate joins."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须在 gmeow:Commitment 上强制该记录的完整性条件时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/commitmentBeneficiaryDistinctness|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when gmeow:Commitment no longer bears the condition — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当 gmeow:Commitment 不再承载该条件时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/commitmentBeneficiaryDistinctness|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read the record's own logic: fields together: they name gmeow:Commitment and the condition asserted over it, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching axiom from them."
msgstr "请一并阅读该记录自身的 logic: 字段：它们命名了 gmeow:Commitment 以及对其断言的条件，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应公理。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/commitmentBeneficiaryDistinctness|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
